    <innerclass refid="class_cell_moisture_interface" prot="public">CellMoistureInterface</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for managing moisture, temperature, and resource capacity in a terrain cell within the ecosystem simulation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This interface defines the environmental behavior associated with a terrain cell, including hydration processes, temperature updates, humidity dynamics, and resource capacity computation. Any concrete moisture model in Weaver must derive from this interface. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
